# Hermes Skill Handoff Formats

## PLAN_TO_SKILL_REQUEST

After Plan Mode, before implementation.

```md
[PLAN_TO_SKILL_REQUEST]

## Task goal
...

## Cursor plan
...

## Current project context
- Framework / relevant files / existing vs expected behavior
- Related AGENTS.md / .cursor rules / skills checked

## Technical uncertainty
...

## Research needed
- Current standard / better algorithm / library / security / performance / Django concerns

## Constraints
...

## Desired Hermes output
Research current standards and project context; suggest a development skill.
Do not simply APPROVE or BLOCK.

Return: research summary, recommended direction, rejected alternatives,
SKILL.md draft or patch, implementation checklist, validation checklist, open risks.
```

## SKILL_APPLICATION_SUMMARY

After Cursor applies a Hermes skill and implements.

```md
[SKILL_APPLICATION_SUMMARY]

## Skill used / implementation summary / files changed
## Tests or validation run / what worked / where skill was unclear
## Deviations from skill / suggested skill improvements
```

## SKILL_IMPROVEMENT_REQUEST

When implementation shows the skill should be updated.

```md
[SKILL_IMPROVEMENT_REQUEST]

## Original skill / problem found / evidence / requested improvement
```

## Hermes response: SKILL_SUGGESTION

`[SKILL_SUGGESTION]` with: research summary, recommended direction, fit for shapez2Factory, rejected alternatives, skill name, `SKILL.md` draft, implementation + validation checklists, risks, follow-up research.
